==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s (1,600%) spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~20 seconds<sup>60f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**3 [[Dober P.D]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam Area Attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] to slowly DPS through the Dober. Research [[Cat Combo]]s are recommended  to meatshield through the Shadow Boxer Ks more effectively.

Wave shields help a lot here, so use cats like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to negate the Dober's wave attacks.

